* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.zip binary
*.obj binary
*.exe binary

# C4 recovery evidence is raw captured bytes: never line-ending converted,
# never re-encoded. The runner and recorder self-tests require `git check-attr
# text` to report `unset` for .bin, .json, .md and .zip under both roots.
docs/superpowers/reviews/evidence/c4-recovery-logs/** -text
docs/superpowers/reviews/evidence/c4-recovery-native/** -text
